@since 3.15.0

A diagnostic report indicating that the last returned
report is still accurate.

@since 3.17.0

The tooltip text when you hover over this link.
If a tooltip is provided, it will be displayed in a string that includes instructions on how to trigger the link, such as `{0} (ctrl + click)`. The specific instructions vary depending on OS, user settings, and localization.
@since 3.15.0

The locale the client is currently showing the user interface in. This must not necessarily be the locale of the operating system.
Uses IETF language tags as the value's syntax (See https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/IETF_language_tag)
@since 3.16.0

The rootPath of the workspace. Is null
if no folder is open.

@deprecated in favour of rootUri.

